message: >-
  If you use ORACLE in your work, please cite it as below.
title: "ORACLE: Online Readout & Acquisition for Collinear Laser spectroscopy Experiments"
type: software
version: 0.6.0
authors:
  - family-names: Barnes
    given-names: Ethan
    email: ethan.barnes@postgrad.manchester.ac.uk
    affiliation: The University of Manchester
abstract: >-
  The data acquisition for collinear laser spectroscopy at IGISOL:
  voltage scans recorded through a time tagger, with a step-and-confirm
  calibration of the voltage axis and a quality gate before every run.
keywords:
  - collinear laser spectroscopy
  - data acquisition
  - IGISOL
